  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_01",
      "hash64": "5A9FE3AEC3AD22D0",
      "text": "Willkommen zur heutigen Stunde.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "5A9FE6AEC3AD27E9",
      "text": "Ich muss schon sagen, ihr habt euch bei der\\nZwischenprüfung alle beachtlich geschlagen.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "5A9FE5AEC3AD2636",
      "text": "Und um euren Fleiß zu belohnen, habe ich einen\\nganz besonderen Gast zu uns in die Akademie\\r\\ngeladen.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "5A9FE8AEC3AD2B4F",
      "text": "Bitte, Señor Colzo, kommen Sie herein![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_01",
      "hash64": "68E2B514A1C72785",
      "text": "Guten Tag allerseits![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_02",
      "hash64": "68E2B214A1C7226C",
      "text": "Mein Name ist Colzo. Ich bin Künstler und habe\\nmich auf Pflanzen-Pokémon spezialisiert.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "5A9FE7AEC3AD299C",
      "text": "Den Schwerpunkt seines künstlerischen Schaffens\\nbilden dreidimensionale Formen wie Skulpturen\\r\\nund dergleichen.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "5A9FEAAEC3AD2EB5",
      "text": "Beispielhaft sei hier auf sein berühmtes Werk\\n„Sonnflora am Wendepunkt“ verwiesen, das man\\r\\nin Bolardin bestaunen kann.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "5A9FE9AEC3AD2D02",
      "text": "Wer von euch die dortige Arena bereits in Angriff\\ngenommen hat, wird es bestimmt kennen.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_03",
      "hash64": "68E2B314A1C7241F",
      "text": "Ja, das ein oder andere Gesicht kommt mir\\nin der Tat bekannt vor.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_04",
      "hash64": "68E2B014A1C71F06",
      "text": "Ihr könnt euch wirklich glücklich schätzen,\\nvon einem Lehrer wie Señor Sinius unterrichtet\\r\\nzu werden![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_05",
      "hash64": "68E2B114A1C720B9",
      "text": "Es gab da nämlich mal eine Zeit der Verzweiflung,\\nals ich alle Hoffnung verloren hatte...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_06",
      "hash64": "68E2AE14A1C71BA0",
      "text": "Doch Señor Sinius schrieb mich nie ab und half\\nmir aus meiner Krise. Er wurde für mich zu einer\\r\\nArt von Mentor.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "68E2AF14A1C71D53",
      "text": "Ohne ihn wäre es mir nicht möglich gewesen,\\nmeinen ganz eigenen kreativen Stil zu finden.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_08",
      "hash64": "5A9FECAEC3AD321B",
      "text": "Colzo...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_09",
      "hash64": "5A9FEBAEC3AD3068",
      "text": "Das Schwelgen in Erinnerungen hat sicher auch\\nseinen Reiz. Doch wann haben unsere Schüler\\r\\nschon mal die Gelegenheit, von einem echten\\r\\nKünstler unterrichtet zu werden?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 172,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_08",
      "hash64": "68E2BC14A1C7336A",
      "text": "Oh, selbstverständlich!\\nDann leg ich gleich mal los.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_09",
      "hash64": "68E2BD14A1C7351D",
      "text": "Gut, wo fange ich am besten an...?\\c\\nVielleicht mit „Sonnflora am Wendepunkt“,\\ndem Werk, von dem eben die Rede war.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_10",
      "hash64": "68E63A14A1CA3F5B",
      "text": "Welches Gefühl empfand ich wohl, als meine\\nHände der Skulptur diesen Ausdruck tiefer\\r\\nEinsicht verliehen? Na, wer weiß es?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "1738F3B775F84FC1",
      "text": "Glück",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "1738F0B775F84AA8",
      "text": "Trauer",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_f_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "1738F1B775F84C5B",
      "text": "Zorn",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_11",
      "hash64": "68E63914A1CA3DA8",
      "text": "Nein, nein, nein! Total daneben![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_12",
      "hash64": "68E63C14A1CA42C1",
      "text": "Als ich jenes Werk schuf, stand ich am Rande der\\nVerzweiflung. Ich war kurz davor, die Flinte ins\\r\\nKorn zu werfen.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_13",
      "hash64": "68E63B14A1CA410E",
      "text": "Sollte mein Werk keinen Gefallen finden, war ich\\nfest entschlossen, der Kunst Lebewohl zu sagen.\\c\\nUnd ein Teil von mir hatte in jenem Moment wohl\\nauch schon damit abgeschlossen...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_10",
      "hash64": "5A9C7EAEC3AA415A",
      "text": "So erklärt sich dann auch der Name „Sonnflora\\nam Wendepunkt“, nicht wahr?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_14",
      "hash64": "68E63E14A1CA4627",
      "text": "Ganz genau, Sinius![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_15",
      "hash64": "68E63D14A1CA4474",
      "text": "Als junger, unerfahrener Künstler litt ich an einer\\nschweren Krankheit.\\c\\nIn der Folge stürzte ich dann in eine tiefe\\nSchaffenskrise.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_16",
      "hash64": "68E64014A1CA498D",
      "text": "Ruhm und Reichtum waren das Einzige, was mir\\nAntrieb verlieh...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_17",
      "hash64": "68E63F14A1CA47DA",
      "text": "Kein Wunder also, dass ich damals nichts als\\ngeschmacklosen Kitsch produzierte![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_18",
      "hash64": "68E63214A1CA31C3",
      "text": "Just in jener scheinbar ausweglosen Zeit lernte\\nich Señor Sinius kennen und er führte mir vor\\r\\nAugen, was für ein Kleingeist ich war!\\c\\nVieles geschah, doch letztlich befreite er mich\\nvon den Scheuklappen, die mir den Blick auf das\\r\\nWesentliche zu lange verstellt hatten...![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 234,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 279,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_19",
      "hash64": "68E63114A1CA3010",
      "text": "Mir war, als hätte mich die Muse geküsst.\\c\\nDie kreative Energie durchströmte meinen Körper\\nund so ward diese Skulptur geboren![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_11",
      "hash64": "5A9C7FAEC3AA430D",
      "text": "Was du nicht sagst... Das wusste ich gar nicht.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
